{"id":2209,"bodyHtml":"<div ><div><p>为进一步增强组织凝聚力，夯实支部规范化建设基础，深化“助研护航—助研筑梦·党建护航”样板党支部品牌内涵，2026年5月10日，航空宇航学院研究生党支部首次开展“我为支部做件事”主题活动，支部党员积极参与，活动氛围浓厚、成效良好。<br></p><p>在“我为支部做件事”主题实践活动引领下，支部党员主动担当，开展主题教育学习分享，由两位党员同志依次主讲领学，首先，党员王廉贺同志以《坚持功成不必在我、功成必定有我，以实干出政绩》为主题进行领学，现场播放经典红色影片《潜伏》精彩片段，并结合剧情进行同步解说，引导全体党员从革命先辈忠诚无畏、担当奉献、实干笃行的崇高精神中汲取信仰力量、筑牢思想根基。</p><p>随后，党员张惠敏同志围绕《完善政绩考核评价体系，用好考核指挥棒》主题领学，梳理了考核要点，并通过政策条例解读视频，深入学习政策出台背景、核心文件精神及价值导向，引导全体党员对照标准自查自省、校准方向、求真务实。学习过程中，全体党员专心听讲、认真记录、深入思考，深刻领会实干担当、为民造福的精神实质，并主动将学习成果与自身科研学习、支部建设、日常工作紧密结合，真正转化为干事创业、服务发展的强大动力。</p><table bordercolor=\"transparent\" imgborderradius=\"5\"><tbody><tr><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/system/resource/virtual_resource_file.jsp?afc=Vozl2PU4vinN-aLd4v8L7nVLmffozU-bM8l4LNQ7MNV2oRN0gihFp2hmCIa0nSysLYhfU1y8oz-PM7CbL8CbLRA2MmGZUlM2M4rkLNLbnmnFnRWVMRr2UmWFMzNsUmlJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aLzlsgtA8pUWcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10157&e=.png\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/E73AB49214F93F908F608ACF75B2C9F4/D2E45FB2/597B5\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/system/resource/virtual_resource_file.jsp?afc=Vozl2PU4vinN-aLd4v8L7nVLmffozU-bM8l4LNQ7MNV2oRN0gihFp2hmCIa0nSysLYhfU1y8oz-PM7CbL8CbLRA2MmGZUlM2M4rkLNLbnmnFnRWVMRr2UmWFMzNsUmlJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aLzlsgtA8pUWcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10157&e=.png\"></div></td><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/system/resource/virtual_resource_file.jsp?afc=VUmV27L87PMzGZMdNCinNCsnlLYnRC-iozAVU4AVnR7bnzG0gihFp2hmCIa0LkyPM1hVMSyiMNlYnRGiM4lPn7M2LzNiUm-aoRLZL46ko7VFL8UYnlMkoRrFMRA7MRLJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aLzlsgtA8pUWcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10157&e=.png\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/016E556E2D05751DCF195B2083837B8A/3D2ECB85/48D43\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/system/resource/virtual_resource_file.jsp?afc=VUmV27L87PMzGZMdNCinNCsnlLYnRC-iozAVU4AVnR7bnzG0gihFp2hmCIa0LkyPM1hVMSyiMNlYnRGiM4lPn7M2LzNiUm-aoRLZL46ko7VFL8UYnlMkoRrFMRA7MRLJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aLzlsgtA8pUWcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10157&e=.png\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table bordercolor=\"transparent\" imgborderradius=\"5\"><tbody><tr><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/system/resource/virtual_resource_file.jsp?afc=VLlL24UmQfMRL8odlUao7rfolr7Uln-2Mml4nmfVMznfU4G0gihFp2hmCIa0oSy8MkyDLkyiMzGPUzfRLzCYnmL4MRVkU4L8UlUboRf7M4TFnm-YMz-ZLzfFMzMknNCJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aLzlsgtA8pUWcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10157&e=.png\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/944605501A0C162F3341BC34AD980D79/F2252810/53BFF\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/system/resource/virtual_resource_file.jsp?afc=VLlL24UmQfMRL8odlUao7rfolr7Uln-2Mml4nmfVMznfU4G0gihFp2hmCIa0oSy8MkyDLkyiMzGPUzfRLzCYnmL4MRVkU4L8UlUboRf7M4TFnm-YMz-ZLzfFMzMknNCJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aLzlsgtA8pUWcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10157&e=.png\"></div></td><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/system/resource/virtual_resource_file.jsp?afc=VM8M2fL7LPMRNbLd77YLzCbM7CZL7n-2MRNZM7QfM4ARU8L0gihFp2hmCIa0U1hRMkysMkyDoz78MmC4L4W7ozliUzCPU4V2LmNaMlM7UNnFozCiLz-PnNrFMRr7MNlJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aLzlsgtA8pUWcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10157&e=.png\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/BC474691466332D955A61C1F2905CDBD/965121FE/45D6E\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/system/resource/virtual_resource_file.jsp?afc=VM8M2fL7LPMRNbLd77YLzCbM7CZL7n-2MRNZM7QfM4ARU8L0gihFp2hmCIa0U1hRMkysMkyDoz78MmC4L4W7ozliUzCPU4V2LmNaMlM7UNnFozCiLz-PnNrFMRr7MNlJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aLzlsgtA8pUWcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10157&e=.png\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table><p>理论学习结束后，孔令斌、吴泽晋、张熠三位党员组织参会党员前往中北大学东区篮球场参加趣味运动会，主动响应“我为支部做件事”主题实践活动，活动现场氛围热烈，党员们积极参与、协作互助，在轻松活泼的互动中缓解了科研压力，增进了彼此交流，在趣味竞技中增进支部凝聚力，以实际行动为支部建设添活力、做贡献。</p><table bordercolor=\"transparent\" imgborderradius=\"5\"><tbody><tr><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/system/resource/virtual_resource_file.jsp?afc=VnR92inlM2Um62ndzQfozrRLRL4Mzr-7L4vsL4VRM8LbnRG0gihFp2hmCIa0oSh2n1hVokhRnzCaU498Uz9PUlrkM77Znl7sMlMfoRlsnzWFMmMfnNWkoRAFMN-4nNlJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aLzlsgtA8pUWcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10157&e=.png\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/9FFE8CE60C84A81AEB4A8EA75CA857E2/63AFBB88/6B3FE\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/system/resource/virtual_resource_file.jsp?afc=VnR92inlM2Um62ndzQfozrRLRL4Mzr-7L4vsL4VRM8LbnRG0gihFp2hmCIa0oSh2n1hVokhRnzCaU498Uz9PUlrkM77Znl7sMlMfoRlsnzWFMmMfnNWkoRAFMN-4nNlJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aLzlsgtA8pUWcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10157&e=.png\"></div></td><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/system/resource/virtual_resource_file.jsp?afc=VM7l2aoRC8M8C8ndNWfMNnVL49DMzG-8nzvDo7MVn7WVnNl0gihFp2hmCIa0MkhfMkh2oShfnmUYo7LYL7MfLRQfUm9aU4W7L7lbMNM7LzWFn7MkU46kM4QFM4TfLR-Jv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aLzlsgtA8pUWcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10157&e=.png\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/4A4F9AF428C20CA06AB80C2D0E96CD12/DCBC7B76/79A02\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/system/resource/virtual_resource_file.jsp?afc=VM7l2aoRC8M8C8ndNWfMNnVL49DMzG-8nzvDo7MVn7WVnNl0gihFp2hmCIa0MkhfMkh2oShfnmUYo7LYL7MfLRQfUm9aU4W7L7lbMNM7LzWFn7MkU46kM4QFM4TfLR-Jv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aLzlsgtA8pUWcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10157&e=.png\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table><p>本次活动既是支部强化理论武装、锤炼党性修养的重要举措，也是深化“党建+科研+服务”融合的生动实践。下一步，航空宇航学院研究生党支部将继续以样板党支部建设为抓手，持续深化“我为支部做件事”系列活动，深化“助研护航—助研筑梦·党建护航”品牌建设，引导党员以实干精神践行初心使命，助力学院研究生成长成才与学科高质量发展。</p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://hkyh.nuc.edu.cn/system/resource/virtual_resource_file.jsp?afc=Vozl2PU4vinN-aLd4v8L7nVLmffozU-bM8l4LNQ7MNV2oRN0gihFp2hmCIa0nSysLYhfU1y8oz-PM7CbL8CbLRA2MmGZUlM2M4rkLNLbnmnFnRWVMRr2UmWFMzNsUmlJv2bjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47aLzlsgtA8pUWcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=10157&e=.png"}